      "writtenOn": "2023-12-15T21:14:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "chip will try to do erase and it will most likely turn many 0 bits to 1, but it fail if not all bits can be erased. So, what I simulate here is that erase tried, it changes some number of bits to 1, but few remains in old state, whatever it was.\n\nPractically, I don\u0027t know how page which wasn\u0027t successfully erased looks like to model it properly. This is a guess on how it may look like.",
      "parentUuid": "99076550_7c29688a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 102,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 105,
        "endChar": 0
