      "writtenOn": "2023-12-15T21:29:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand, my point is that if a page after erase has unerased bytes, the preceding erase operation would have returned some error code.\n\nI guess it does not hurt to check for this explicit case when erase operation returned succes but the page is not erased, just in case.",
